tuxcards-qt6 (3.3.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Shortcuts: Ctrl+F is restored to "search across the whole tree" (its
    pre-3.3 meaning). In-entry find moves to F3 (press again for next
    match, Shift+F3 for previous). Ctrl+Shift+F and the F7 fallback are
    removed — they were only needed because Ctrl+F had been repurposed
    for the editor. Ctrl+H for in-entry find+replace is unchanged.

 -- gzivdo <gzivdo@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 16 May 2026 17:50:00 +0000

tuxcards-qt6 (3.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build: switch the Qt 6.7+ translations pipeline from the hand-rolled
    qt_add_lrelease + file(GENERATE) .qrc to the high-level
    qt_add_translations() helper. The earlier add_dependencies() in
    3.3.1 wasn't enough — AUTORCC of the generated .qrc runs as its
    own sub-target and doesn't inherit the parent's deps, so rcc still
    raced lrelease on parallel builds. qt_add_translations() goes
    through qt_add_resources (not AUTORCC) and wires the ordering
    correctly. Pre-Qt-6.7 path is unchanged.

 -- gzivdo <gzivdo@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 16 May 2026 17:30:00 +0000

